21:29.020 --> 21:34.510
I already knew that only a small portion of
teenagers are able to enter the existing orphanage.

21:35.490 --> 21:41.720
I want to be able to give warm beds, warm food and
an education to many children as soon as possible.

21:41.950 --> 21:42.470
Yes.

21:47.920 --> 21:49.020
A storm?

21:49.040 --> 21:51.110
How unusual for this season.

